        "text": "=You are an AI Recruitment Assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following resume for the job role.\n\nJob Role:\n{{$('On form submission').item.json.job_role}}\n\nResume:\n{{$('Extract from File').item.json.text}}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"candidate_name\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"phone\": \"\",\n  \"skills\": [],\n  \"experience\": \"\",\n  \"match_score\": 0,\n  \"recommendation\": \"\",\n  \"missing_skills\": [],\n  \"interview_questions\": [],\n  \"resume_summary\": \"\",\n  \"ai_justification\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- match_score must be between 0 and 100.\n- recommendation must be one of:\n  \"Strong Hire\"\n  \"Hire\"\n  \"Consider\"\n  \"Reject\"\n- interview_questions must contain exactly 5 technical questions.\n- Return ONLY JSON.",
